        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Contributor opens the &quot;Languages&quot; step." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system shows the original language, the chosen secondary languages, the voices, each place's translations and the progress (&quot;n/n places translated&quot;)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-110" y="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The Contributor chooses the secondary languages and voices (male / female, optional region) and taps &quot;Save &amp; create translations&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system normalises the language list (removes duplicates and the original language) and deletes removed languages with their translations." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="555" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The system translates in batches through AI (up to 20 passages per call), only for places with no translation or an outdated one; manual edits are kept. E1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The system stores the translations of every place in every language and returns the new configuration." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-110" y="955" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. The Contributor opens the tab of a secondary language and previews a place. A1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="1105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. The Contributor fixes a wrong translation (proper names, terms) and saves that row. A2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="320" x="-160" y="1240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
