        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E1. AI translation error (timeout, 5xx, wrong number of translations) → 503 &quot;Automatic translation failed, please try again&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="708" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. Language code outside the supported set → 400 &quot;Unsupported language: xx&quot;; editing a language that is not configured → 400 &quot;Language is not configured for the tour&quot;; editing the original language → edit it in UC#10." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="250" x="355" y="1160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. The browser cannot play → &quot;The preview could not be played. The translation is kept; you can try again.&quot;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="1325" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1. Preview: the system reads the translation with the device's voice (Web Speech), label &quot;Preview with the device voice · no audio file yet&quot;. E3." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-510" y="1210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A2. Edit a translation: the translation is marked &quot;edited by hand&quot; and is kept on later saves. E2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-910" y="1400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A3. Remove a secondary language: the system deletes the language and its translations." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-1310" y="1400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A4. The original description changes (UC#10): the system translates that place again; manual edits are kept but get a &quot;Needs review&quot; chip." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-1710" y="1400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A5. A tourist requests automatic translation into a language that is not enabled (UC#04 A7): the translation is stored separately and shown in the Languages step; if the author enables that language, the translation is reused without calling AI again." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="165" width="220" x="-2110" y="1400" as="geometry" />
